    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The previous Platinum harbored a secret love for his target, and so for the sake of protecting the object of his affections, he died at the Armorless Union's hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "As a result, the girl of today was pushed hastily into the position, our 'youngest Platinum.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She is a gifted mark, make no joke, and I must say her strong potential makes her unignorably suited for the role... but in all other respects, she is far and away one of the least mature to ever assume the position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I see... Why are you telling me this? The Armorless Union's existence should be classified... so aren't you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, do lay your concerns aside. It's simply been on my mind quite a bit as of late. Had I not made the effort to get to where I am today, I would hardly enjoy the privilege to ponder it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you know? Our present Platinum was elected to the position by the very Platinum before her, doomed to die as he was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "A great deal of food for thought... Not to mention why the Armorless Union would listen to a traitor, to say nothing of how electing this girl would have absolutely no impact on his own death sentence. For what reason did he do this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the arrow of his own colleague shot through his chest, did he think to cry out? To whom? Of what? To what end? Would it have been that easy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I remember correctly, you a S\u0142oma employee, correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yeah... so far in the event, I've been responsible for liaising between the major companies and the Knights Association...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Errand work takes quite the toll.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's no problem. If I can contribute to the business, that's what I'm here for\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No no no, your work is what they pay your salary for. You needn't use such humble language.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "You apparently had your own business before. What made you abandon it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... I didn't have what it took...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What distinguishes failure and success may be more than ability. Perhaps you have chosen the wrong path to walk, or perhaps you walk as I do now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "P-People like me only...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In Kazimierz, anything is possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sportsbar",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Zofia... feels like an age since I saw you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Marcin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Have you seen Maria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Something cropped up. Had her head back home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I see\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I smell blood. Hold on. What are these bandages?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has Maria been hurt? Who was she fighting? What happened?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told her not to be rash! Why doesn't this silly girl\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Steady, now. It's some other kid who got hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone went for the Ashlock and Flametail Knights out of nowhere... Ashlock got injured, and by a mighty stroke of something, they ended up in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "This morning, they said they didn't want to cause Nearl any more trouble and left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do things like that just happen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're in a hell of a tight spot, but our hands are tied.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seen the news this morning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's Maria doing now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Competing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Competing in what? Against who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Unguarded one-on-one, just like with Ingra. Head to head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Against 'Left-hand' Tytus Topola.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on\u2014who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blade Helmet Knightclub commander. Noble knight, big commercial name, been as far as the Final 16. Tytus Topola.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But... But there should be no way Maria gets matched against him at her point level, and his social standing is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone came looking for Maria. It wasn't good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's just like Margaret used to be. Obsessed with charging forward, no idea how to deal with the corporates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You think... she's like Margaret?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret KNEW what she was doing. Maria only got like this after falling for her own wishful thinking about her own ideals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not even clear what's in front of her, and she doesn't know what to do about it. She can't keep pushing upwards like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria was so much more carefree before this... She doesn't need to be the kind of knight you and I were, does she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You might be right, but you need to remember she's got her own mind for things. You can't decide it all for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's still real young, and uneasy at that. Maybe her being carefree was all just so she wouldn't worry you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria might not come off mature a lot of the time, but what kind of kid without a fighting spirit could overcome the Plastic Knight, come to a draw with Brassrust, hold third place in a melee?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she ought to lose a match. It'd sober her up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're telling me that's what you really think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Which arena is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
