    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ladiiiiiiies\u2014aaaand gentlemeeeenn! Welcommme, to the Fireblade Arena, and welcome to a very special event today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "An event already drawing the greatest media attention since the start of the preliminaries! Right at this verrry moment, all twelve imprints of the Rose Paper Union are zeroed in on one arena!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "And not just that\u2014whoa, put your hands together now for the Fireblade Arena, the third largest in Kazimierz! Because today! Every single seat has been filled!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are our opponents today just that popular?! Or is this going to be one seriously major show?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's my job to tell you the answer is\u2014booooth!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I gotta say\u2014what a privilege!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "In today's special event! Our first competitor, hailing from the Nearl family, the mania for her's off the charts! The marvelous maiden knight who's got all her fans talking\u2014Maria Nearl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "And facing her\u2014! The concealed blade, the height of status, named for the old knight of legend, it's the headliner of the Blade Helmet Knightclub, it's 'Left-hand' Tytus Topola!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooooh, man! Might be a first, today\u2014the knights haven't even come in yet, but the prize pool is running insane numbers! Looks like I oughta stop running my mouth already\u2014I bet y'all wanted me to stop, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I got you! No time to lose! Would our two knights please enter the arena!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "First on the battlefield is Maria Nearl! Just like always, pure white armor! Just like always, a delicate stance!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "After defeating 'Plastic' Szewczyk, she's been marching victorious! Big or small, no matter the event, Maria Nearl brings her A-game!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Standing here now, she declared way back she had to get a place in the Major! Can she use this match as a stepping stone, and rise to the apex of the Kazimierz knights? We're all waiting to see!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I never did that...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "And in the other corner\u2014please\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up, motormouthed clown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your sort don't deserve to stand in my arena. Get off the stage. Get out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
