        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nearl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugly sight. Struggling to hold onto your family's knighthood. Like a gloompincer out of water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "With no strength to bear a knight's name, what service will shamelessly lashing out do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Your words mean nothing to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "So they shall. May the last Nearl knight be ruined by my own hand today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fear not. I'm a different breed from Ingra's dross... You will know today that not all who bear weapons can be called knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
