    {
        "text": "Cleaving... the light?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is that so hard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was thinking I'd rend your sword straight in two, hmph... the Nearl family sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "You hold shakily to your faith, but you know nothing true of faith. You are naive\u2014weak\u2014feeble-minded\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unworthy to stand before me.",
        "tag": "name",
